("api/set-stc-styling" :names ("set-stc-styling") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Invoke native GetLength, SetStyling. Arguments use the checked native domains described in the styled-text guide." :position 457678)
("api/set-web-page" :names ("set-web-page") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Asynchronously loads HTML with native base URL resolution. JavaScript remains enabled; loading does not sanitize HTML or isolate its network/storage effects." :position 458784)
("api/show-modal" :names ("show-modal") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Run the native modal loop. Supported from menu/event callbacks, RUN or a pump; nested public SHOW-MODAL calls reject. Outer event contexts suspend during the modal call and become usable again after it returns; callbacks entered by the modal loop have their own valid innermost contexts. Bare callback errors cancel the modal operation and re-signal the primary condition after unwind. A nested notifying operation whose condition is handled locally can recover without cancelling. Manual RUN/pump/finish and structural menu edits remain guarded. Native close of the current dialog is consumed and cancels it; ancestor close events are consumed while modal. Public CLOSE-WINDOW on a protected ancestor rejects. Generic file UI prompts are redirected to guarded generic message dialogs. Internal prompts suspend borrowed contexts; errors or public cancellation unwind internal-to-outer sequentially. Cancelling an inner prompt normally returns to the outer dialog. Nested public SHOW-MODAL remains forbidden." :position 460889)
("api/show-stc-autocomplete" :names ("show-stc-autocomplete") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Show native autocomplete list using configured separator; applications supply items and acceptance policy." :position 464263)
